        <h2 class="sp-intro-heading" data-ps="src/pages/practice-area/saline-domestic-violence.astro:u0r7no">Saline Domestic Violence Charges Require An Experienced, Established, and Capable Defense. We Defend These Charges:</h2>
        <img
          class="sp-main-image"
          src="https://pagesmith-cdn.com/ee60f2da/images/66aa4f5d078bef17fc3fa3b1_criminal9-96492d-1536.webp"
